localserver_codex_task_prompt.other:
[$teamsboard]({{.SkillPath}})

Use the teamsboard Skill to handle the following local TeamsBoard task.
Task UUID: {{.TaskUUID}}
Tool: {{.Tool}}
The binding request type must equal the tool. For Codex, read thread_id only from the CODEX_THREAD_ID environment variable (on Windows, $env:CODEX_THREAD_ID). That value is supplied by the current session. Do not guess or scan old sessions. When it is empty, skip binding, still report the final reply, and omit thread_id. Claude Code, CodeBuddy and Qoder use the current session ID; Pi uses the session ID shown by /session.
Keep this conversation bound to the task and follow the Skill's per-turn sync rules until the conversation ends.

